001846  833B  0621                                    MOVE R6, @R8
001847  833C  0520                                    MOVE R5, R8
001848  833D  1FA0  0001                              ADD SDB_E_NBLK_HI, R8
001849  833F  0721                                    MOVE R7, @R8
